00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:13.848 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(sifflements)

00:00:11.512 --> 00:00:15.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
... la simple citoyenne

00:00:12.713 --> 00:00:16.283 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Catherine McKenna prend

00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:17.484 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le temps de souffler.

00:00:15.149 --> 00:00:18.719 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La vie n'est plus la même

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:19.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour cette ancienne ministre

00:00:17.585 --> 00:00:20.754 size:53% position:73% line:53%
libérale qui a fait ses adieux

00:00:18.853 --> 00:00:21.788 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la politique.

00:00:19.854 --> 00:00:22.823 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CATHERINE McKENNA, ancienne

00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:23.824 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministre fed. de l'Environnement

00:00:21.889 --> 00:00:24.859 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et de l'Infrastructure

00:00:22.923 --> 00:00:25.893 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'ai l'air heureux,

00:00:23.924 --> 00:00:26.927 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tout le monde me dit toujours

00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:27.928 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que j'ai l'air heureux!

00:00:25.993 --> 00:00:28.963 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ses années tumultueuses comme

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.964 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministre de l'Environnement

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.998 size:53% position:73% line:53%
semblent déjà loin derrière,

00:00:29.063 --> 00:00:32.032 size:53% position:73% line:53%
