00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:33.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des traces.

00:00:31.098 --> 00:00:34.068 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'ai très vite compris

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:38.572 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'il y a des gens qui

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:39.573 size:53% position:73% line:53%
voulaient utiliser que

00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:40.608 size:53% position:73% line:53%
j'étais femme contre moi.

00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:41.609 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Femme et ministre, elle est

00:00:39.673 --> 00:00:42.643 size:53% position:73% line:53%
devenue la cible des opposants

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:43.677 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au prix sur le carbone,

00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:52.620 size:53% position:73% line:53%
exposée au harcèlement

00:00:42.743 --> 00:00:53.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et aux attaques constantes.

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:55.055 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Même du personnel politique de

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:58.325 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son propre parti lui reprochait

00:00:53.921 --> 00:00:59.526 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de laisser trop de place

00:00:55.189 --> 00:01:00.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à ses émotions.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:01.962 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'ai eu un message

00:00:59.627 --> 00:01:06.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
